   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Consonants that were removed",
     "texto": [
      "The agreement removes **unpronounced** consonants in the relevant variety: **ação** (formerly *acção*), **ótimo** (formerly *óptimo*), **atual** (formerly *actual*).",
      "The rule follows pronunciation: in Portugal the **c** of **facto** is kept and pronounced; in Brazil **fato** is common, without that consonant. A silent letter is not kept just because it appears in another word of the family."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Other spellings",
     "texto": [
      "It is written **receção** in Portugal and **recepção** in Brazil, depending on whether the **p** is pronounced. **Direção** and **açúcar** take **ç**. Since the agreement, the noun is written **pelo**, without a circumflex, the same as the contraction **por + o**; the verb *pôr* keeps its accent."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
